            {
              "$type": "Models.Factorial.Experiment, Models",
              "DisabledSimNames": null,
              "Name": "RELARC_02",
              "ResourceName": null,
              "Children": [
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                  "Text": "###RELARC 02###\r\n\r\nThis simulation was adapted from a defoliation trial conducted in 2000-2001, at Russell E. Larson Agricultural Research Center, Pennsylvania, USA.  The trial was established in small plots, replicated five times, with plantain forage sown in April-1999 (Cultivars '*Lancelot*' and '*Tonic*'.  Only data from the first year is used as the population declined markedly in the second winter.  All plots received 4.5 t/ha of limestone and were fertilized with 56 kg N/ha in April, June and July of 2000.  The soil at the site was a Hagerstown silt loam (fine, mixed, semiactive mesic Typic Hapludalfs).  \r\nEach plot was mechanically mowed to height of 7cm every 4 weeks.  Only annual and treatment yields are reported, however population was given for specific dates.  Dates for each harvest were reported.  From these data, yield was arbitrarily inferred for each harvest, therefore they should be seen as rough approximation only (N variation between cultivars were considered here).  \r\nMet file was built using data obtained from NOAA website.  The data set was largely complete except for solar radiation, which was added from an alternative interpolated set for this location, also from NOAA.  \r\nInformation to assemble the soil data was obtained from USGS.\r\n\r\nReferences:  \r\nSanderson, M.A.; Labreveux, M.; Hall, M.H.; Elwinger, G.F. 2003. Forage yield and persistence of chicory and english plantain. Crop Science, 43: 995-1000.",
                  "Name": "Memo",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                },
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Factorial.Factors, Models",
                  "Name": "Factors",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [
                    {
                      "$type": "Models.Factorial.Factor, Models",
                      "Specification": "",
                      "Name": "Cultivar",
                      "ResourceName": null,
                      "Children": [
                        {
                          "$type": "Models.Factorial.CompositeFactor, Models",
                          "Specifications": [
                            "[Sowing]"
                          ],
                          "CustomDescriptors": [],
                          "Name": "Lancelot",
                          "ResourceName": null,
                          "Children": [
                            {
                              "$type": "Models.Operations, Models",
                              "OperationsList": [
                                {
                                  "$type": "Models.Operation, Models",
                                  "Enabled": true,
                                  "Date": "1999-04-28",
                                  "Action": "[PlantainForage].Sow(population: 300, cultivar: \"Lancelot\", depth: 10, rowSpacing: 150)",
                                  "Line": "1999-04-28 [PlantainForage].Sow(population: 300, cultivar: \"Lancelot\", depth: 10, rowSpacing: 150)"
                                }
